  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d95f71226bf26bc4caed6a0458a3b538, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lesson 3 Qestion 3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  question: What does it mean when we say the God is immense?
  answers:
  - He's tiny
  - He is greater than all creation, and all things are in Him
  - He is an intense guy
  - Phone a friend
  correctAnswerIndex: 1
  discussionAnswer: God is greater than anything else.  He is not bound by His creation
    in any way; in fact, He tells us in His Word that all of creation belongs to
    Him (Acts 17:27-28)
